WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:01.710
What do you think you're
going to find out there?

00:00:03.086 --> 00:00:05.213
You know how many people I’ve
gone down the rabbit hole with?

00:00:06.214 --> 00:00:07.799
It’s a dead end every time with this case.

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.300
When is this going to stop?

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:13.138
There are things you don't
want to know about.

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:18.309
If you displease the right people,

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:22.772
the world closes in
on you very, very fast.

